  "description": "Years ago, Daniel Barton made a contract with a demon to survive. When he stole the demon’s name and fled, the creature vowed to hunt him down. Now, Daniel is a mediator for an organization keeping the existence of non-human creatures a secret. When a case involving the First Lady’s death brings him to Washington, Daniel reunites with Jesús Miller, the one whose name he stole. Though he has yet to be recognized, Daniel is worried that Jesús' growing interest in him may make escape impossible…\n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes 12 extra chapters.*",
